# Bagisto AliExpress Dropship — scheduled product sync
#
# Runs the extension's `dropship:product:update` command every 5 minutes to pull
# fresh price and quantity data from AliExpress for imported products.
#
# Install into the crontab of the user that owns the Bagisto app, e.g.:
#   crontab -e        # then paste the line below
#   crontab -l        # verify it is installed
#
# Replace /project_root_folder_path with the ABSOLUTE path to your Bagisto
# project root (the directory that contains `artisan`), and `php` with the full
# path to the PHP binary if it is not on cron's PATH (`which php`).
#
# NOTE: this command is a no-op unless BOTH of these are enabled in the store
# admin under Configuration > Dropship settings:
#   - dropship.settings.auto_updation.price
#   - dropship.settings.auto_updation.quantity

*/5 * * * * php /project_root_folder_path/artisan dropship:product:update
